
 [33mUsage:[0m [1mnewline_control.py[0m [[1;36mOPTIONS[0m]

 Newline control
 [2mDouble newlines are always preserved. But single newlines are usually not.[0m
 [2mThere are however a few situations where we preserve single newlines.[0m
 [2mIndented lines with 4+ spaces are preserved:[0m
 [2m    ```python[0m
 [2m    from foo import bar[0m
 [2m    [0m
 [2m    bar.action()[0m
 [2m    ```[0m
 [2mUnordered lists are preserved:[0m
 [2m- like[0m
 [2m- this[0m
 [2malso:[0m
 [2m* newlines within unordered lists are collapsed down.[0m
 [2m* pretty neat![0m
 [2mLast but not least, we preserve:[0m
 [2m> block[0m
 [2m> quotes[0m

